# Pairs with PersistedBeliefHonest, and reproduces issue #4017: the checkpoint
# commit wrote the advance into state.State before awaiting the persist, and a
# persist that threw left it there, so the activation went on believing it had
# durably recorded an offset storage never received.
MODULE: PersistedBeliefHonestFailedPersistKeepsAdvance
TARGET: PersistedBeliefHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed checkpoint persist is not rolled back
PERTURBS: PersistFail

--- FIND
    /\ faults < MaxFaults
    /\ stCp' = stCp
--- REPLACE
    /\ faults < MaxFaults
\* MUTATION: no rollback of the commit.
    /\ stCp' = [stCp EXCEPT ![l] = rp[l]]
--- END